## Outcome

Close Stage 7-C against the accepted PR #23 evidence without starting Stage 8, opening the sealed test split, or committing large model artifacts.

## Changes

- mark Stage 7-C closed and exact-main CI verified across README, STATUS, ARCHITECTURE, runbook, and the Stage 7-B implementation profile;
- add `STAGE7C_EVIDENCE.md` as the durable small provenance record with exact source, runtime, dataset, benchmark, metrics, checkpoint, verification, and archive hashes;
- record the fail-closed first-run history and the accepted grammar-constrained rerun;
- state the material quality limitation: 0% exact sequence accuracy and ~80.5% token error rate, so no production-candidate claim is made;
- state the Actions artifact expiry and require a separate artifact-storage decision before later checkpoint-byte reuse;
- remove the PR #23 one-shot benchmark and authoritative-training jobs from recurring CI;
- keep the ordinary pinned-runtime, full-regression, `pip check`, and `compileall` CI gate.

## Verified evidence

- Stage 7-C PR source: `7a993304218fa19609ea512665148dac3eea503a`;
- Stage 7-C main merge: `2c2c478eb361fa90a3bccd819b623680eb12de0b`;
- exact-head run #67 (`31691794239`): success, 361/361 tests, safe benchmark, accepted authoritative run;
- post-merge run #68 (`31692849892`): success, 361/361 tests;
- accepted archive SHA-256: `69b41888dc52e46c7bff1d278ce55ffddcaf0b24b2ee5c22cbb2e73f6f2d31cf`;
- checkpoint SHA-256: `75c33cefeb970305f5f9171b3274dbe8b785cbcf1e8d6851de7848e66d24efa4`;
- metrics SHA-256: `c715f49be804bc89b157a7c1b8d8b72209c7083636470ff4e47e5c16833073fe`;
- verification SHA-256: `afce43cc4c3e11fc1ee13492b15b61f619147d6a52577ffc60765dab1ddc1f84`;
- sealed test split opened: false.

## Local validation

- `git diff --check`: passed;
- Python `compileall`: passed;
- grammar-constraint focused tests: 5/5 passed;
- workflow check: no actionable findings; only the bundled older linter's stale unknown-label warning for GitHub's valid `ubuntu-24.04`;
- the downloaded accepted archive was re-read and its exact values matched the new durable evidence record.

## Locked boundary

This PR does not start Stage 8, Stage 9, or Stage 10; does not open or score the test split; does not ingest real/user data; does not run full training; and does not merge without separate explicit approval.

Repository rulesets are currently empty. The connected GitHub integration receives HTTP 403 for branch-protection management, so that repository setting cannot be changed by this PR or connector and remains an explicit external hardening item.

